Let $x_{ij} \geq 0$ denote the quantity shipped from warehouse $i \in I$ to store $j \in J$ (continuous).

##### Parameters

- Warehouses $I = \{S1, S2, S3, S4, S5\}$
- Stores $J = \{D1, D2, D3, D4, D5\}$

